Maarefa — educational content licence
=====================================

This licence covers the CONTENT of this directory: the Arabic lesson prose in
content/, the problem pages, the visual step data (*.steps.ts), and the
hand-authored SVG visuals in src/components/visuals/static/.

The site's SOURCE CODE is licensed separately under MIT — see LICENSE at the
repository root. The two are deliberately different: the code is meant to be
reused freely, the writing is not meant to be repackaged and sold.

    Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International
    (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0)

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

You are free to:

  Share  — copy and redistribute the material in any medium or format
  Adapt  — remix, transform, and build upon the material

Under the following terms:

  Attribution   — give appropriate credit to Maarefa (https://maarefa.pages.dev),
                  link to the licence, and indicate if changes were made.
  NonCommercial — you may not use the material for commercial purposes.
  ShareAlike    — if you remix or build upon the material, you must distribute
                  your contributions under this same licence.

WHAT IS NOT COVERED
-------------------

Quoted compiler output, error messages, and any code emitted by the Rust
toolchain are not this project's to license. Rust itself is dual-licensed under
MIT and Apache-2.0 by the Rust Foundation and contributors.

The fonts in public/fonts/ are subsets of IBM Plex Sans Arabic and JetBrains
Mono, both under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, and carry their own terms.
